| T<n> | Quarterly rotation of the Pritunl console admin password, both sites | brainstorm | prod-fable, prod-codex | — | — | operator poll: superpowers for Codex CLI, then round 1 | operator | ruling 2026-09-28 (every task is brainstormed) | no |
```

